    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθαρ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destructive,</i> c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθαρτικὰ ἀλλήλων τὰ ἐναντία</span> one of another,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				192a21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κακία φ. ἀρχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1140b19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1281a20
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1452b11
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικός, γενητικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Top.</u>
				114b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				124a25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα οὐ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. φαρμακεῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.134e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>
			<i>deadly</i> poisons, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβρύων φ.,</span>
			v. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόριος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				166
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.105
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.764
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					153b32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
